    "created_at": "2021-08-02T20:44:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-08-02T20:44:03Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the feedback. Surveying the API landscape it looks like programmatically specifying the PIN code is possible on Android, Linux (BlueZ) and Windows. It does not appear to be possible on macOS. That does seem like enough to make it worthwhile but it will be something we can't guarantee is available for developers.",
