    "created_at": "2021-08-02T20:51:00Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-08-02T20:51:00Z",
    "body": "The passkey pairing in Bluetooth usually does not make much sense from a security point of view if it's not done interactively by the user. In particular a hardcoded passkey should be avoided if you want to avoid what might seem like unexpected attacks. See https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/issues/36005.",
